# Browser
# X = 3: every creature with mana value 3 or less loses all abilities until end of turn and is destroyed - the caster's own
# Embereth Shieldbreaker (2) too, and Bot2's Llanowar Elves (1). Bot2's Ulvenwald Oddity (mana value 4) is no part of "each
# creature with mana value X or less": it is not destroyed and keeps Haste and Trample. Sylvan Caryatid (2) is saved by a
# regeneration shield from Yavimaya Hollow made in response (CR 701.19): the shield is no ability of the creature, so it
# still replaces the destruction, and the Caryatid ends the turn tapped and without Defender and Hexproof.
# The page says so on the card: the Caryatid's printed lines, each greyed as no longer its own,
# the Oddity, which kept its abilities, has none greyed.

